# Jadawel — Arabic catalogue for the `database` contrib app.
#
# Upstream Baserow ships no `ar` catalogue, so every backend gettext string
# fell through to its English source. Table creation runs inside
# `translation.override(user.profile.language)` (see table/handler.py), which
# means the default view name is translatable — it just had nothing to
# translate to. This file supplies the Arabic strings we care about; untranslated
# entries keep falling back to English, which is the desired behaviour.
#
# `django.mo` next to this file is the compiled form and is what Django actually
# reads. Regenerate it after editing this file (see PATCHES.md).
#
